                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This is the main data table describing biological taxonomy bone elements (anatomical entities) bone fusion and physiological sex determinations for zooarchaeological data from several Epipaleolithic - Chalcolithic sites in Anatolia. These data integrated and published in Open Context represent one outcome of the Encyclopedia of Life Computational Data Challenge a project led by Benjamin Arrbuckle in collaboration with the zooarchaeologists listed here.\r\n"
